  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Cut capsicum and zucchini into small chunks. Slice red onion into wedges.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b53df9ed1d2f11d218ce/step-190a0400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, combine the water and stock concentrate and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b53df9ed1d2f11d218ce/step-62878b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• In the last minute of cook time, add the honey, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b53df9ed1d2f11d218ce/step-481c7920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with couscous, add roasted veggies, rocket leaves and a squeeze of lemon juice. Toss to combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Divide roast veggie couscous between bowls. Top with haloumi, hummus and pine nuts.\n• Tear over parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b53df9ed1d2f11d218ce/step-0a21ba30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
